  "design": {
    "decision": "Bid 8 only when you can make it. Unlike the bid-trigger version, a set gives nothing, though it isn't amplified either.",
    "opponent": "Shown at scoring on a made 8. Opponents defending a big contract also deny this multiplier.",
    "rationale": "This is the common +mult rung of the make-8 line, which today has only rare seeds. It differs from seed-bid8-mult by paying only on a make, which tests whether safe or risky high-bid multipliers play better.",
